  ("What type of HVAC system suits an older Whitby home?", "It depends on the ducts. If the house has sound ductwork, a high-efficiency furnace or hybrid heat pump works well, and if it has radiators or no ducts, ductless heads are usually the cleanest choice."),
  ("Do new Brooklin homes need an HRV?", "Many newer homes already have one, and it needs regular cleaning and balancing to work properly. If yours is missing or not doing its job, foggy windows and stale air are the usual clues."),
